Use ODRL vocabulary with namespace "https://example.org/research-snapshot#".
Use prefix eval with namespace "https://eyereasoner.github.io/eyemind/odrl#".
Use prefix ex with namespace "https://example.org/research-snapshot#".
Use prefix odrl with namespace "http://www.w3.org/ns/odrl/2/".

evaluation is an evaluationReport.
evaluation has policy agreement1.
evaluation has conflictStrategy prohibit.
ready is a request.
ready has assignee researcher.
ready has action odrl:use.
ready has target directory.
ready has subject visitor.
ready has state researchState.
ready has fulfilledDuty credit.
pending is a request.
pending has assignee researcher.
pending has action odrl:use.
pending has target directory.
pending has subject visitor.
pending has state researchState.
marketing is a request.
marketing has assignee researcher.
marketing has action odrl:use.
marketing has target directory.
marketing has subject visitor.
marketing has state marketingState.
marketing has fulfilledDuty credit.
evaluation has validationStatus valid.
marketing has unmetConstraint scope.
ready has applicablePermission researchUse.
pending has uncertainty witness(rule 286, "Issue", ex:pending, ex:credit, ex:researchUse, eval:MissingDutyEvidence).
witness(rule 286, "Issue", ex:pending, ex:credit, ex:researchUse, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) is an uncertainty.
witness(rule 286, "Issue", ex:pending, ex:credit, ex:researchUse, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) has reportDuty credit.
witness(rule 286, "Issue", ex:pending, ex:credit, ex:researchUse, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) has rule researchUse.
witness(rule 286, "Issue", ex:pending, ex:credit, ex:researchUse, eval:MissingDutyEvidence) has reason eval:MissingDutyEvidence.
evaluation has conflictCount 0.
evaluation has request pending.
pending has decision undetermined.
evaluation has request ready.
ready has decision allowed.
evaluation has request marketing.
marketing has decision notApplicable.
evaluation has canHappen ready.
